  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "統計專題(一)",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS IN STATISTICS(1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是分組學生對不同專題做深入或廣泛的研討。冀望此專題的學習讓學生應用所學過的統計理論與商管知識、或整合數據分析方法與熟練統計相關的軟體。而團隊的討論與分工合作可培養學生溝通的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course students will be divided into groups to present and discuss various topics with breadth or depth.  Students are expected to integrate what they have learned in statistical theory, business knowledge, management skills, data analysis methods, and statistical software to solve problems. Emphasis is placed upon teamwork, written and oral communication in their presentations and discussions.",
